809→          <div class="horizon-possible">Your multi-agent review pipeline and 5-specialist orchestration sessions show the pattern works, but sessions like the GPU competition reveal agents drifting into unbounded exploration. Spawning parallel agents with strict time and scope budgets—one for benchmarking, one for kernel writing, one for submission—could have turned those 143-minute infrastructure sessions into actual leaderboard submissions.</div>
