811→          <div class="pattern-prompt"><div class="prompt-label">Paste into Claude Code:</div><code>You are an orchestrator agent. Spawn exactly 3 parallel sub-agents for this project, each with a STRICT scope and a maximum of 10 tool calls before reporting back:
812→
813→Agent 1 - RESEARCHER: Read the existing codebase in [PATH] and produce a concrete list of the top 3 optimization opportunities with expected impact. No code changes.
