815→Agent 2 - IMPLEMENTER: Take the current best-known approach from [REFERENCE] and implement it directly. Run benchmarks after each change. No planning documents.
816→
817→Agent 3 - VALIDATOR: Run the full test/benchmark suite, collect baseline metrics, and prepare the submission pipeline so results can be submitted immediately.
818→
819→After all agents report back, synthesize their findings, apply the best implementation, validate it, and submit. Do NOT build new infrastructure or frameworks.</code><button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyText(this)">Copy</button></div>
