824→          <div class="horizon-possible">You&apos;re running vault-keeper cycles, health audits, and enrichment passes that still hit stale plans and orphaned state. A fully autonomous maintenance daemon could run against your Obsidian vault and codebase on a schedule—detecting drift, healing orphans, enforcing link integrity, and updating skills files—without you needing to trigger or supervise each pass.</div>
