831→4. VERIFY: Re-scan the vault and confirm the issue count decreased. If any fix introduced new problems, revert it.
832→5. COMMIT with message &apos;vault-keeper: healed N issues&apos; and output a summary diff.
833→
834→If SurrealDB or any dependency is down, diagnose and fix it BEFORE starting the audit. Do not skip this step.</code><button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyText(this)">Copy</button></div>
